WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.449
Place two settlements and their starting roads.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:09.399
Collect resources as the dice roll. Build out from your roads.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.649
Upgrade settlements to cities and compete for awards.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.000
P3 reaches 10 victory points and wins.
